{"4179280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moonshiner Simulator", "steam_appid": 4179280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonshiner Simulator</strong> is an in-depth spirits production simulator. Start from the bottom and build your operation into a thriving empire by mastering the intricacies of the craft and creating <strong>unique recipes</strong>. But beware – there will always be those who want to see you fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the entire process</strong> — from brewing mash and moonshine to crafting fine whiskey, liqueurs, and dozens of other spirits. Experiment with ingredients and discover <strong>special recipes</strong> to impress even the most discerning connoisseurs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/323babc4c983ef72de0fcdf4220682cf.poster.avif?t=1788195452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/323babc4c983ef72de0fcdf4220682cf.webm?t=1788195452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/323babc4c983ef72de0fcdf4220682cf.mp4?t=1788195452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Business, Your Rules:</strong> Start with hand-to-hand sales and gradually expand your distribution network. <strong>Hire assistants</strong>, optimize logistics, and find new outlets to make your name known far and wide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/f7ff3dc6eebc5560ead92b00514d51f7.poster.avif?t=1788195452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/f7ff3dc6eebc5560ead92b00514d51f7.webm?t=1788195452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/f7ff3dc6eebc5560ead92b00514d51f7.mp4?t=1788195452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve Your Operation:</strong> Begin with a homemade still and work your way up to professional equipment. Purchase and upgrade new facilities, transforming them into powerful and efficient mini-factories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/4627d56e33ab1067289fc5c77dc46229.poster.avif?t=1788195452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/4627d56e33ab1067289fc5c77dc46229.webm?t=1788195452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/4627d56e33ab1067289fc5c77dc46229.mp4?t=1788195452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strength in Numbers!</strong> Team up with friends in co-op mode for up to 8 players to build and manage your booze empire together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179280/extras/1e6496825c343b70509007381a4f4e88.poster.avif?t=1788195452\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/